## LeftNav-UC3 — User Logout

- Primary Actor(s): User
- Secondary Actor(s): None
- Trigger: User selects the logout option.
- Description: Processes user logout and redirects to the appropriate URL.
- Preconditions: User is logged into the system.
- Postconditions: User is logged out of the system.
- Main Success Scenario:
  1. User clicks the logout button.
  2. System calls the `Logout` function.
  3. User is redirected to the specified URL post-logout.
- Extensions:
  - Users can be redirected to different URLs based on settings.
- Exceptions:
